 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Demon Lord Reincarnated as a Slave ~Rising to the Top to Rewrite History~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "異世界魔王の奴隷譚～転生したら奴隷だったので、仕方なしに瞬時に成り上がろうと思います～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "To fight the monstrous \"Outsiders\" invading from outer space, the world's strongest Hero and Demon Lord joined forces. However, their alliance was ultimately defeated. In a desperate bid to change history, the Demon Lord, with the help of Hero's secret technique to reverse time and undergo reincarnation.\n\nReborn as a boy who was bullied and enslaved in noble society, the Demon Lord now faces a cruel new reality.\n\n\"Why is a slave so strong?!\" \"Strong? He’s not just strong—he’s a monster!!\"\n\nWith his overwhelming strength from his previous life intact, the Demon Lord trains relentlessly to rise to the top and ensure victory this time!"
  },
